      "writtenOn": "2021-10-01T15:10:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My preference would be to return the individual queries, or have both. Most places probably want the query and will be more readable if the bitmask \u0026 is hidden. On the other hand, having access to the full flags could be useful in cases where you want to ensure two textures have the exact same set of usages.",
      "parentUuid": "bdd0fd09_998790e3",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 29,
        "startChar": 4,
